When Irene's husband gets out of jail, he enlists
Driver's help in a million-dollar heist.

6
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:51,000
The job goes horribly wrong, and Driver must risk his life to protect Irene
and Benicio from the vengeful masterminds behind the robbery.

